                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1948, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">vii</hi>, p. 593</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d509-f2" n="33" xml:id="d509-f2-content">
                <p>Signed at Moscow with the National Government of China; United Nations Treaty
                    Series, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">x</hi>, p. 300.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
